  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "SwFrame and SwLayoutFrame retain actual registered owners and source-shaped null/upper/next/previous/lower pointers. Native construction, typed GetFormat, original InsertBehind and RemoveFromLayout and recursive lower teardown follow pinned wsfrm/ssfrm contracts; full native geometry/flags/fly/content/follows/accessibility/UNO remain unverified.",
    "SwRowFrame creates actual original SwCellFrame children in box order. Native matching box claims retarget physical cell clients before model registration; distinct change and SaveTable movement hints retain original box/frame identity.",
    "Real row/column/table deletion removes matching physical cells from their original links and destroys frames before original model clients; final represented client releases its native format. Ordinary RemoveBox remains nondestructive.",
    "Main JSX traverses actual native row lower/next frames; collapsing painter and width measurement borrow registered native format items with success/exception finally teardown. No frame clone, side-map layout graph, cell DTO cache or TextRuns conversion.",
    "All657 prior acceptance files remain byte-identical. Existing316 metadata records fields/status/default/classification/order/prefixes retained and one unverified wsfrm record appended to317; no promotion. Protected IO/recovery deviations, whole writer-view, pin and stash preserved; goal ACTIVE."
  ]
